{
  "id": "auto-research",
  "group": "agent-eval",
  "description": "Composable auto-research layer — wires the eval-harness's scenarios + judges + regression gates into agent-eval's optimization primitives (runMultiShotOptimization, runPromptEvolution, runProposeReview, PairwiseSteeringOptimizer, paretoFrontier). Lets a family run hypothesis-driven prompt + steering evolution against the same harness used for measurement. Required by agent-research-harness-ts.",
